<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LENS DEFENDER REGIS JOINS KARLSRUHE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LENS DEFENDER REGIS JOINS KARLSRUHE.</headline>
<dateline>LENS, France 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defender David Regis of French first division Lens signed a two-year contract with German side Karlsruhe on Wednesday, Lens sources said.</p>
<p>At Karlsruhe, who qualified for next season's UEFA Cup, Regis will play alongside another Frenchman, international striker Marc Keller.</p>
</text>
